[["這家店每次經過生意都蠻好的.再次經過剛好午餐時間，就來個雞湯麵當午餐吧！可能期待值高所以標準也拉高.點了松露牛肝菌雞湯麵.裡面有雞腿肉、雞胸肉、酒肉丸跟雞胗，因為我不敢吃雞胗所以不加.雞腿肉偏乾、雞胸肉軟嫩、雞丸子風味最有層次.麵選正常，軟硬度ok，但麵沒煮均勻，吃到一坨未煮開的麵條❌’湯聞起來香中飄著松露味.但湯很鹹反而把松露味跟牛肝菌壓過去.整體表現正常不帶特色.（甜點是贈送的喔）",null,[0,194]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDFWNlFUVlhhbWhPV2xWS1NFMXVUWGhXTVd4cFpHeGFURTlYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDFWNlFUVlhhbWhPV2xWS1NFMXVUWGhXTVd4cFpHeGFURTlYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDFWNlFUVlhhbWhPV2xWS1NFMXVUWGhXTVd4cFpHeGFURTlYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDFWNlFUVlhhbWhPV2xWS1NFMXVUWGhXTVd4cFpHeGFURTlYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDFWNlFUVlhhbWhPV2xWS1NFMXVUWGhXTVd4cFpHeGFURTlYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDFWNlFUVlhhbWhPV2xWS1NFMXVUWGhXTVd4cFpHeGFURTlYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,16773,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKT1V6QTVXamhOWlVKSE1uTXhWMWxpZGxaTE9XYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xcbc224e90c6ad2fe!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkJOUzA5WjhNZUJHMnMxV1lidlZLOWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKT1V6QTVXamhOWlVKSE1uTXhWMWxpZGxaTE9XYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKT1V6QTVXamhOWlVKSE1uTXhWMWxpZGxaTE9XYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKT1V6QTVXamhOWlVKSE1uTXhWMWxpZGxaTE9XYxILMGRHWjg4S05EckgaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09r