淇淋，算是給這一餐做了一個簡單的收尾。",null,[0,93]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVVZKSE1IaFRSRkp0V1ZkV01GcEZWa3hSYTFaMFRsWmFjMVJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVVZKSE1IaFRSRkp0V1ZkV01GcEZWa3hSYTFaMFRsWmFjMVJyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVVZKSE1IaFRSRkp0V1ZkV01GcEZWa3hSYTFaMFRsWmFjMVJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVVZKSE1IaFRSRkp0V1ZkV01GcEZWa3hSYTFaMFRsWmFjMVJyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVVZKSE1IaFRSRkp0V1ZkV01GcEZWa3hSYTFaMFRsWmFjMVJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10130315969850992271/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVVZKSE1IaFRSRkp0V1ZkV01GcEZWa3hSYTFaMFRsWmFjMVJyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2044,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kUVJHMHhTRFJtWVdWMFpFVkxRa1Z0TlZac1RrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xcbc224e90c6ad2fe!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmdQRG0xSDRmYWV0ZEVLQkVtNVZsTkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kUVJHMHhTRFJtWVdWMFpFVkxRa1Z0TlZac1RrRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kUVJHMHhTRFJtWVdWMFpFVkxRa1Z0TlZac1RrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kUVJHMHhTRFJtWVdWMFpFVkxRa1Z0TlZac1RrRRILMGRreVg2UDV4V0gaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tZFFSRzB4U0RSbVlXVjBaRVZMUWtWdE5WWnNUa0USCzBka3lYNlA1eFdIIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR_tJqDOkkwssqCzBka3lYNlA1eFdI\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj_4qrVwdKWAxXTnK8BHceHH